# L §5.16, §7.3 (round 6): quantile of a normal distribution value needs to u: without it, LOAD-TO.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
input lvl: num
def qn: num = quantile(normal(0, 1), lvl) at reader

version v
